Package: mcp-server-abraflexi
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3-abraflexi,
         python3-fastmcp,
         python3-dotenv,
         python3-typing-inspection
Provides: abraflexi-mcp-server
Replaces: abraflexi-mcp-server (<< 1.4.4~)
Breaks: abraflexi-mcp-server (<< 1.4.4~)
Description: MCP server for AbraFlexi integration
 A comprehensive Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for AbraFlexi
 integration using FastMCP and python-abraflexi.
 .
 This server provides complete access to AbraFlexi REST API functionality
 through MCP-compatible tools, enabling AI assistants and other tools to
 interact with AbraFlexi accounting systems.
 .
 Features:
  * Invoice management (issued and received)
  * Contact/company management
  * Product management
  * Bank transaction management
  * Generic evidence operations
  * Read-only mode by default for security
  * Support for STDIO and HTTP transports

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-abraflexi
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
         mcp-server-abraflexi (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Registers AbraFlexi MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-abraflexi. Installing it registers
 the abraflexi-mcp-server binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
